<title>NEW ZEALAND: RTRS - FCL Energy sees more investment.</title>
<headline>RTRS - FCL Energy sees more investment.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Energy said on Wednesday it expected reinvestment to be up 15 percent on the previous year's through exploration development and a minor acquisition in Canada.</p>
<p>&quot;We continue to look for larger acquisitions but will move only when we are convinced that prices have reached a level where they would be value-creating for us,&quot; chief executive Michael Andrews told a news conference.</p>
